Q: Display different dimensions on columns and rows with SSAS and MDX A: <p>The query below might work for you. You mentioned you dont have "all" members in your cube, so you need to replace the "all" in the query with respective default members. I have tried to make a similar senario in Adventure works. The cells have internetSales amount</p>

<pre><code>               | topSeller | Bottom Seller  | 2011| 2012 | 
Topcustomers   |
Bottomcustomers|
North America  |
