Q: Is it possible to do a sparse checkout without checking out the whole repository first? A: <p>Works in git v2.37.1+</p>
<pre><code>git clone --filter=blob:none --no-checkout --depth 1 --sparse &lt;project-url&gt;
cd &lt;project&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>Specify the folders you want to clone</p>
<pre><code>git sparse-checkout add &lt;folder1&gt; &lt;folder2&gt;
git checkout
</code></pre>
